OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1794324376
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APhones to be banned from pupils' bags
OL,4,Aor pockets under stricter rules for
OL,5,Aschools in England
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters now say changes to that
OL,8,Fguidance will go beyond the current "no
OL,9,Fsee, no hear" policies in place in some
OL,10,Fschools - where phones can remain in
OL,11,Fpupils' bags if they are not seen or
OL,12,Fheard - when it comes into force from
OL,13,FSeptember 2027.
OL,15,FBut head teachers' unions said schools
OL,16,Fwould struggle to implement stricter
OL,17,Fnew policies without additional funding
OL,18,Ffrom government.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
